  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "these are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the divisions of the sons of Aaron. The sons of Aaron; Nadab, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Nadab and Abihu died before their father, and had no children: therefore Eleazar and Ithamar executed the priest's office.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David distributed them, both Zadok of the sons of Eleazar, and Ahimelech of the sons of Ithamar, according to their offices in their service.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there were more chief men found of the sons of Eleazar than of the sons of Ithamar; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thus",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "were they divided. Among the sons of Eleazar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sixteen chief men of the house of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fathers, and eight among the sons of Ithamar according to the house of their fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus were they divided by lot, one sort with another; for the governors of the sanctuary, and governors",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of the house",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of God, were of the sons of Eleazar, and of the sons of Ithamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Shemaiah the son of Nethaneel the scribe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the Levites, wrote them before the king, and the princes, and Zadok the priest, and Ahimelech the son of Abiathar, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "before",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the chief of the fathers of the priests and Levites: one principal household being taken for Eleazar, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "taken for Ithamar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the first lot came forth to Jehoiarib, the second to Jedaiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The third to Harim, the fourth to Seorim,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fifth to Malchijah, the sixth to Mijamin,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seventh to Hakkoz, the eighth to Abijah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ninth to Jeshua, the tenth to Shecaniah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eleventh to Eliashib, the twelfth to Jakim,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The thirteenth to Huppah, the fourteenth to Jeshebeab,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The fifteenth to Bilgah, the sixteenth to Immer,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The seventeenth to Hezir, the eighteenth to Aphses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The nineteenth to Pethahiah, the twentieth to Jehezekel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The one and twentieth to Jachin, the two and twentieth to Gamul,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The three and twentieth to Delaiah, the four and twentieth to Maaziah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the orderings of them in their service to come into the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", according to their manner, under Aaron their father, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of Israel had commanded him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the rest of the sons of Levi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were these:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the sons of Amram; Shubael: of the sons of Shubael; Jehdeiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Concerning Rehabiah: of the sons of Rehabiah, the first",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isshiah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Of the Izharites; Shelomoth: of the sons of Shelomoth; Jahath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sons",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of Hebron;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.24.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeriah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
